text = "Move Around
Use WASD to explore the world

Gather Resources
Chop trees and collect materials to build your supplies.

Improve Your Skills
The actions you perform will increase your 
skills over time.

Craft New Tools
Use gathered resources to create better equipment 
and unlock new possibilities.

Explore
Discover new areas and see what ADAN has to offer!

Your Goal
Collect achievements, improve your skills, discover new areas, 
and become the best ADAN player possible!"
