text = "Controls
[E] - Chop Trees or Punch Rocks
[G] - Smack NPCs
[T] - Equipment Page
[B] - Bag / Inventory
[K] - Skills Page
[L] - Crafting Menu
[Y] - Achievements

Skills
ADAN currently has 
four available skills with four more coming soon!

🌳Barkbreaking🌳
Collect logs and craft better axes to chop stronger trees.

Rockpunching
Punch rocks to gain experience and improve your strength.

👊Smacking👊
Smack humanoids to gain experience.
(Some NPCs are hidden throughout the world)

🏃Footwork🏃
Simply playing the game and moving around will 
improve your Footwork skill.
gain xp

